cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Ollama LLM Local Inference Benchmarking Suite"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-light Python toolkit for benchmarking locally-served large language models through
  the Ollama daemon. Measures inference throughput and stability across a structured prompt suite,
  and scores output correctness against GSM8K, HumanEval and TruthfulQA via EleutherAI's
  lm-evaluation-harness, including a custom HumanEval task that works correctly against
  chat-completions backends. Produces publication-ready LaTeX tables, heatmaps and bar charts.
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/t3dr0/ollama_benchmark"
